## Commit Message Rules

When generating a Git commit message, write it ONLY in Spanish (español).
Ignore the language of previous commits. Previous messages are in English; do not copy that language.

Output one subject line in Spanish. No English sentence.

Examples:
- Añadir la estructura inicial del proyecto
- Corregir la conexión a la base de datos
- Actualizar la configuración de Docker

Never output messages like "Add initial project structure" or "Fix database connection".
